<!-- The Last Gallon: the fermentation vessel carried in both arms while
     crouched and still. With isMoving false it has one condition more than
     tlgcarryvesselsneak.xml, so the game plays it when a crouched character
     stops. Its clip, Bob_TLG_CarryVesselSneakIdle (media/anims_X/Bob), is
     tlgcarryvesselsneak.xml's keyed for the first frame of the game's
     Bob_IdleSneak instead, whose chest stands 17 degrees from the crouch
     walk's (art-src/carry/PROVENANCE.md). Checked in game:
     docs/test-results.md. -->
<animNode>
